1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:09,218
Alcohols show four kinds of isomerism: chain, position, functional, with ethers of the same formula, and optical.

2
00:00:09,218 --> 00:00:19,791
C four H ten O has four alcohols: butan one ol, butan two ol, two methyl propan one ol, and two methyl propan two ol.

3
00:00:19,791 --> 00:00:21,901
And three ethers.

4
00:00:21,901 --> 00:00:26,575
Butan two ol has a carbon with four different groups, so it is chiral.

